Why the disposition is RETURN_ONLY, ON_HOLD or MANUAL_RECOVERY;
 REASON_UNSPECIFIED otherwise, and for a deposit ON_HOLD for review
 without a more specific reason.

types.doc:
ListKeysResponse lists the broker's API keys newest first: by creation
 time, then key ID, both descending. A broker has at most two working keys;
 revoked and expired keys stay listed.

fields.doc:
Monotonic state version: a snapshot with a lower version is older. Zero
 while ALLOCATING; 1 once the deposit address is issued (AWAITING_DEPOSIT)
 or allocation ends without one (EXPIRED with DEPOSIT_ADDRESS_CONFLICT);
 every later change increments it.
